        "content_sha256": "06c537485a2c566e3ee252bf5d15ab4d072cb228ca6e0ecd472db56f92dafc57",
        "summary": "더욱 견고해진 블랙과 풍성한 플라워 디테일, 군더더기 없이 정제된 미니드레스와 한층 유연해진 레더까지. 2026 F/W 런웨이를 수놓은 7개의 패션 키워드. FLORAL BLOOM ERDEM GIVENCHY CHANEL DIOR McQUEEN 런웨이 위로 꽃의 달콤한 향기가 피어올랐다. 이번 시즌 디자이너들은 저마다의 방식으로 플라워 모티프를 해석하며 로맨틱한 무드에 힘을 보탰다. 불꽃처럼 화려한 플로럴 장식으로 강렬한 포인트를 더한 샤넬과 디올, 큼직한  [...]",
        "body_text": "<p>더욱 견고해진 블랙과 풍성한 플라워 디테일, 군더더기 없이 정제된 미니드레스와 한층 유연해진 레더까지. 2026 F/W 런웨이를 수놓은 7개의 패션 키워드.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2><br>FLORAL BLOOM</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-21 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"559045\" src=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559045\" srcset=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-200x300.jpg 200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-400x600.jpg 400w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-600x900.jpg 600w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-800x1200.jpg 800w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-1200x1800.jpg 1200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223.jpg 1667w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af20a6223-940x400.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"559043\" src=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559043\" srcset=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-200x300.jpg 200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-400x600.jpg 400w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-600x900.jpg 600w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-800x1200.jpg 800w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-1200x1800.jpg 1200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e.jpg 1667w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af209451e-940x400.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"559044\" src=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559044\" srcset=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-200x300.jpg 200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-400x600.jpg 400w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-600x900.jpg 600w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-800x1200.jpg 800w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-1200x1800.jpg 1200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6.jpg 1667w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af2095dd6-940x400.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-23 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"559046\" src=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559046\" srcset=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-200x300.jpg 200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-400x600.jpg 400w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-600x900.jpg 600w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-800x1200.jpg 800w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-1200x1800.jpg 1200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3.jpg 1667w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46665b3-940x400.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"683\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"559047\" src=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-559047\" srcset=\"https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-200x300.jpg 200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-400x600.jpg 400w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-600x900.jpg 600w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-800x1200.jpg 800w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-1200x1800.jpg 1200w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d.jpg 1667w, https://img.marieclairekorea.com/2026/09/mck_6a97af46c593d-940x400.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>런웨이 위로 꽃의 달콤한 향기가 피어올랐다. 이번 시즌 디자이너들은 저마다의 방식으로 플라워 모티프를 해석하며 로맨틱한 무드에 힘을 보탰다. 불꽃처럼 화려한 플로럴 장식으로 강렬한 포인트를 더한 샤넬과 디올, 큼직한 꽃송이와 대담한 디테일로 시선을 사로잡은 지방시와 에르뎀까지. 드레스와 재킷은 물론 액세서리 곳곳에 꽃이 만발한 모습이다. 올가을에는 룩 어디에든 시들지 않는 꽃을 피워보는 건 어떨까? 일상에 낭만을 더하기에 이보다 더 근사한 방법은 없을 테니 말이다.</p>",
